@Notify_HostAddress = http://localhost:5065

### Health Check Probe
GET {{Notify_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: text/plain

###

### Send Email Notification (Dispatches email asynchronously and returns 202 Accepted)
POST {{Notify_HostAddress}}/email
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "messageId": "3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa6",
  "to": "recipient@example.com",
  "subject": "Order Confirmation",
  "body": "<h1>Thank you for your order!</h1><p>Your items are being prepared.</p>"
}

###

### Get Email Trace Status
GET {{Notify_HostAddress}}/email/3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa6
Accept: application/json

###

### Send SMS Notification (Dispatches SMS asynchronously and returns 202 Accepted)
POST {{Notify_HostAddress}}/sms
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "messageId": "9b1deb4d-3b7d-4bad-9bdd-2b0d7b3dcb6d",
  "mobile": "+1234567890",
  "message": "Your verification code is: 123456"
}

###

### Get SMS Trace Status
GET {{Notify_HostAddress}}/sms/9b1deb4d-3b7d-4bad-9bdd-2b0d7b3dcb6d
Accept: application/json

###

